&lt;section class="about-section section-wrap" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-title"&gt;
  &lt;div class="section-marker"&gt;01 / A QUICK HELLO&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;div class="about-grid"&gt;
    &lt;h2 id="about-title"&gt;A tiny site.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;A happy start.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
    &lt;div class="about-text"&gt;&lt;p&gt;Every big project begins somewhere. This one's intentionally simple: a friendly mascot, a clean layout, and a few places to add things later.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="small-note"&gt;No real name, email, location, or social accounts are shown here. That can stay exactly as it is until you choose otherwise.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/section&gt;

&lt;section class="explore-section section-wrap" id="explore" aria-labelledby="explore-title"&gt;
  &lt;div class="section-head"&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="section-marker"&gt;02 / SPACE TO GROW&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="explore-title"&gt;A little of &lt;em&gt;everything.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Three blank spaces for whatever you want to share. No pressure to fill them today.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;div class="card-grid"&gt;
    &lt;article class="feature-card card-lilac"&gt;&lt;div class="card-top"&gt;&lt;span&gt;01 / PROJECTS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span aria-hidden="true"&gt;↗&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="card-icon" aria-hidden="true"&gt;✳&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Things I make&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;A future home for little projects, experiments, and ideas.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;span class="card-bottom"&gt;COMING TO LIFE SOON&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/article&gt;
    &lt;article class="feature-card card-yellow"&gt;&lt;div class="card-top"&gt;&lt;span&gt;02 / NOTES&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span aria-hidden="true"&gt;↗&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="card-icon" aria-hidden="true"&gt;✎&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Things I learn&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;A place for notes, discoveries, and the occasional happy accident.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;span class="card-bottom"&gt;WORDS WILL GO HERE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/article&gt;
    &lt;article class="feature-card card-mint"&gt;&lt;div class="card-top"&gt;&lt;span&gt;03 / JUST FOR FUN&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span aria-hidden="true"&gt;↗&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="card-icon carrot" aria-hidden="true"&gt;🥕&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Things I love&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;A friendly reminder that websites don't always need to be serious.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;span class="card-bottom"&gt;MORE FUN AHEAD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/article&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/section&gt;

&lt;section class="closing-section section-wrap" id="note" aria-labelledby="closing-title"&gt;
  &lt;div class="section-marker"&gt;03 / ONE LAST THING&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;h2 id="closing-title"&gt;That’s all&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;for now.&lt;/em&gt; &lt;span aria-hidden="true"&gt;✳&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
